                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Khukhwimba khwe kimienya kie kamatuungu, ne kimimilo kie babaandu ne bakhupi be kimilele, nende be chikhoombi, se baliuliilikhanakho lundi mwiwe tawe! Mbao omukholi owe sisiindu siosi siosi sie bukhala olibonekhela mwiwe lundi tawe; liiuliilikhana lie lususi se liliba lundi mwiwe tawe! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.22"
            ]
          }
        },
