              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buwaanga bwe taa se bulibonekha mwiwe lundi tawe; namwe kumumilo kwo mundu niye baakhile se kuliuliilikhanakho lundi mwiwe tawe. Baboofuli bowo baba be kamaani kamakali khukhila mu sibala sioosi, khubirira mu bufumu bwowo bwe bubeeyi wabea babaandu be mu sibala!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.23"
            ]
          }
        }
